      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Abual-Fad\u0323l, son of Ghazal the Alexandrian, came</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;And obligated himself with a qinyan of his own free will</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>And not under duress, (so) that he will pay his wife,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Mother of his children, every month 20</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Dirhem, each week 5 dirhems and 2 portions</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Of wheat of high quality and the cost of their grinding. And already</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>He obligated her to him with a qinyan so that she will pay</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>From these 20 dirhems whatever he owes, such as</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>For the poll tax, and the rent for the house and the expenses</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Of her household. And she will not request (of him) anything, as</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Long as he pays her this (sum) via the supervision of</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The court. And he will not demand of her (earnings from)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Her handiwork or her spinning and not that which (even)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Has the smallest value. And they both agreed to this</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Together. And we performed with him a complete qinyan</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>With an implement fit for doing this. And this was</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>On the first of the month of Tishrei 1133.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Nathan the Cohen, son of Solomon the Cohen, may his soul rest in paradise.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
